{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484820,"name":"zyzhou","username":"zyzhou-saffron","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/zyzhou-saffron/{size}/120094_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:51:35.248Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCannot send any Grok Bot message. Every send fails with “Couldn’t send your message. Check your connection and try again.” / “Failed to send”. Messages stay local only (no requestId / sendAcceptance ack). Bots never reply. Roster/history still sync.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe same account also cannot send on Android. This is not one bad chat and not a local Mac-only attach issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStarted 2026-09-07 09:55 CST (UTC+8), immediately after desktop auto-update to 0.44.0 (ShipIt replaced the app ~09:55:53–09:56:02). Last successful bot replies were 2026-09-06 evening.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooks like the same class as \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/170834\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot fails to generate replies; Agent Computer screen is still visible\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/170661\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot 0.43.0 — Bot failed to respond; Reset Agent Computer stuck in partial state\u003c/a\u003e : shared cloud computer stuck; client reconnect cannot fix it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUse Grok Bot macOS 0.44.0.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen an existing bot conversation/create new bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a short message with no tools, e.g. “ping”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe send fails within a few seconds (“Couldn’t send your message. Check your connection and try again.” / “Failed to send”).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit with Cmd+Q and reopen — same failure.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign out and sign back in — same failure.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the same account on Android and send a short message — same failure.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessages should send and get replies on both Mac and Android\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.44.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484820-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484820-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConversation IDs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e04f98b2f-0829-49ce-a821-d4a00cd65f7d\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1327d3bd-c900-4d66-a005-ac6afdb69298\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c